{"subject_id": "9013021", "chunk_id": "90f912ea1de6", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "供销社产业链动态：", "date_hint": "2025年1月9日", "global_order": 1, "source": "detail_html", "created_at": "2026-04-02T12:18:41", "source_id": "detail_9013021_0", "order": 1, "used_fallback": false, "event_date_raw": "2025年1月9日", "text": "为满足福州市民及广大消费者对高品质、便捷性与安全性兼具的新鲜 '放心菜' 的需求，同时为福州市民提供安全、优质的蔬菜供应。"}
{"subject_id": "9013021", "chunk_id": "af6dbdf305e6", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "供销社产业链动态：", "date_hint": "2024年8月9日", "global_order": 10, "source": "detail_html", "created_at": "2026-04-02T12:18:41", "source_id": "detail_9013021_0", "order": 10, "used_fallback": false, "event_date_raw": "2024年8月9日", "text": "近日，2024年全国供销合作社农资网络体系建设暨'绿色农资'升级行动推进会在江苏省兴化市召开。"}
